    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "***Stunning Golf Course Views***\n***Fantastic Location***\n***Easy Access For Naas or Newbridge***\n\n***This is a 3-bedroom home currently arranged as a two-bedroom home, which can be easily restored to a 3 Bed. \n\nHere at Byrne Malone, we are delighted to present Tankardsgarden to the market for sale by private treaty. This charming bungalow is ideally positioned on a private and mature site of circa 0.4-with Newbridge Golf Course to the side and rear. Set in a mature location surrounded by trees and shrubs, the property enjoys a wonderful sense of privacy and tranquillity while still being conveniently located close to local amenities. \nA spacious entrance hallway welcomes you into the home and leads through to a bright and inviting sitting room. This attractive living space features wooden flooring, decorative coving, a feature fireplace, and a large picture window that floods the room with natural light while offering lovely views of the surrounding greenery. The fully fitted kitchen provides ample worktop and storage space, making it both practical and functional for everyday living. Adjacent to the kitchen is a comfortable seating area, ideal for casual dining or relaxing with family and friends. A separate utility room and an additional bathroom are conveniently located just off the kitchen area.\nThis house has three bedrooms, the current owners have changed the layout slightly to make two generously proportioned bedrooms, both finished with wooden flooring and benefiting from an abundance of natural light, creating bright and airy accommodation throughout. The main bedroom features an open walk-in wardrobe along with a neatly tiled en-suite bathroom. \nOutside, the mature gardens are a standout feature of the property, offering views over the golf course and excellent outdoor space for entertaining, gardening, or simply enjoying the peaceful surroundings. The large site also provides ample parking and further potential for outdoor enjoyment. \nThis location offers excellent connectivity for a quick and convenient commute to Dublin, with Junction 10 of the M7 motorway just five minutes away. Both Newbridge Train Station and Sallins (Naas) Train Station are within a short drive, providing additional transport options. The towns of Newbridge and Naas are located approximately 5 and 10 minutes away, respectively, offering a superb range of shopping, recreational, and educational amenities. \nTankardsgarden offers a rare opportunity to acquire a charming home in a scenic and highly desirable setting overlooking the golf course.\n\n\n"
      },
